<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: sans-serif;
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #222;
    }
    .nav-links {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      margin-right: 1rem;
      color: #0066cc;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    textarea {
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 6px;
      resize: vertical;
    }
    .form-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
    .char-counter {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #666;
    }
    button[type="submit"] {
      padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #fff;
      background-color: #0066cc;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button[type="submit"]:disabled {
      background-color: #99bce0;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }
    .status-box {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .loading {
      background-color: #f4f6f8;
      color: #444;
    }
    .error {
      background-color: #fdecea;
      border: 1px solid #f5c2c7;
      color: #842029;
    }
    .answer {
      background-color: #f8fbff;
      border: 1px solid #cfe2ff;
    }
    .answer h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #084298;
    }
    #answer-content {
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
    [hidden] {
      display: none !important;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav-links">
    <a href="/">TOPへ戻る</a>
    <a href="/todo">TODO一覧へ</a>
  </nav>

  <h1><%= title %></h1>
  <p>疑問点や調べたいことを入力してください。AI（Gemini）が回答を生成します。</p>

  <form id="ai-question-form" novalidate>
    <label for="question-input" hidden>質問内容</label>
    <textarea
      id="question-input"
      name="question"
      rows="5"
      maxlength="1000"
      placeholder="例: TypeScriptの型推論のメリットを簡潔に教えてください。"
      required
    ></textarea>
    <div class="form-footer">
      <span id="char-count" class="char-counter">0 / 1000</span>
      <button type="submit" id="submit-btn">質問する</button>
    </div>
  </form>

  <div id="loading-indicator" class="status-box loading" role="status" hidden>
    回答を生成しています。しばらくお待ちください...
  </div>

  <div id="error-box" class="status-box error" role="alert" hidden></div>

  <section id="answer-box" class="status-box answer" hidden>
    <h2>AIからの回答</h2>
    <div id="answer-content"></div>
  </section>

  <script src="/ai/ai.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>